# ── Patient data and credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# CODA-TB holds raw cough recordings and clinical metadata rows for real
# participants. These are research data under a data-use agreement, not source.
# Never commit them; only the derived manifests under deploy/ are tracked.
/coda-tb/

# Firebase Admin key downloaded from the console. The repo uses .env.local
# instead; a downloaded JSON key must never reach git history.
serviceAccountKey.json
serviceAccountKey.*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

